---
import DetailLayout from "../../layouts/DetailLayout.astro";
---

<DetailLayout
  title="Napa Lake"
  description="Napa Lake, Shangri-La Yunnan: seasonal highland lake with yak pastures and snow mountain views. Horse riding, sunset spots, and travel tips."
  category="Attraction"
  image="napa-lake.webp"
  schema={{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "TouristAttraction",
    "name": "Napa Lake",
    "description": "A seasonal highland lake near Shangri-La that transforms into vast grasslands in dry months. Yak and horse grazing with snow-capped mountain backdrops.",
    "publicAccess": true
  }}
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Napa Lake</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">A seasonal highland lake that transforms into a vast grassland. Yak and horse grazing with snow-capped mountain backdrops. Stunning at sunset.</p>

  <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
    <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3 text-center"><span class="block text-xs text-slate-400">Altitude</span><span class="block mt-0.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">3,266 m</span></div>
    <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3 text-center"><span class="block text-xs text-slate-400">Time Needed</span><span class="block mt-0.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">2&ndash;4 hrs</span></div>
    <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3 text-center"><span class="block text-xs text-slate-400">Best Season</span><span class="block mt-0.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">May&ndash;Oct</span></div>
    <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3 text-center"><span class="block text-xs text-slate-400">Ticket</span><span class="block mt-0.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">60 RMB</span></div>
  </div>

  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Overview</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Napa Lake (u7eb3u5e15u6d77) is a seasonal alpine lake located just 8 km northwest of Shangri-La city center. Its defining feature is its dual personality: during the summer monsoon (June&ndash;October), it swells into a shimmering lake reflecting the surrounding mountains. In the dry winter months, the waters recede dramatically, revealing vast grasslands where Tibetan herders graze yaks, horses, and sheep.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">The lake is part of the larger Napa Lake Nature Reserve, an important wintering ground for migratory birds including the rare black-necked crane. Over 40 species of waterfowl can be observed here from November through March. The surrounding landscape is classic Shangri-La: rolling green hills dotted with prayer flags, traditional Tibetan farmhouses, and the Shika Snow Mountain range forming the backdrop.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Unlike Pudacuo which feels like a managed park, Napa Lake offers a raw, wide-open experience. You can ride a horse across the grasslands (50&ndash;100 RMB, negotiable), walk along the water's edge, or simply find a quiet spot and watch the light change over the mountains. It is arguably the best sunset location near Shangri-La.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">How to Get There</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 space-y-5">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-5">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">Bicycle (Recommended)</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Rent a bicycle in Dukezong Old Town for <strong>30&ndash;50 RMB/day</strong>. The ride to Napa Lake is 8 km on a flat, scenic road. Takes about 40 minutes. E-bikes are also available for 80&ndash;100 RMB. This is the most enjoyable way to reach the lake and gives you flexibility to explore the shoreline.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-5">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">Taxi or Didi</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">A taxi from the old town costs <strong>30&ndash;40 RMB</strong> (15&ndash;20 minutes). Agree on a time with your driver for pickup or arrange a round trip (80&ndash;100 RMB total) as taxis are scarce at the lake.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Food &amp; Dining Nearby</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">There are a few Tibetan family-run food stalls at the main entrance selling yak butter tea (10 RMB), instant noodles (10 RMB), and grilled yak skewers (5&ndash;10 RMB each). For proper meals, bring a picnic or eat back in the city. The combination of an afternoon at Napa Lake followed by dinner in Dukezong Old Town makes for a perfect half-day itinerary.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Travel Tips</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">&rarr;</span> <span><strong>Go for sunset.</strong> Arrive around 5:00 PM. The golden hour light on Shika Snow Mountain reflected in the lake is one of the most photogenic scenes in Shangri-La.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">&rarr;</span> <span>Horse riding prices are negotiable. Start your offer at 60% of the quoted price.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">&rarr;</span> <span>In winter (Nov&ndash;Mar), the lake mostly dries up. It's still beautiful as grassland but a very different experience. Bring binoculars for birdwatching.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">&rarr;</span> <span>Wear waterproof shoes in the rainy season &mdash; the grassland can be boggy.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-6">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-700">Nearby &raquo;</p>
    <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <a href="/attractions/dukezong-old-town/" class="rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">Dukezong Old Town</a>
      <a href="/attractions/songzanlin-monastery/" class="rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">Songzanlin Monastery</a>
      <a href="/attractions/pudacuo-national-park/" class="rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-slate-700 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors">Pudacuo National Park</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DetailLayout>